## 🔍 What Gets Extracted?

| Field | Priority | Auto-Set | Fallback |
|-------|----------|----------|----------|
| **Title** | Meta tags → H1 → `<title>` | ✅ | ✅ |
| **Summary** | Meta description → Sapo → First paragraph | ✅ | ✅ |
| **Content** | Article body → Fallback paragraphs | ✅ | ✅ |
| **Images** | Content images | ✅ | ✅ |
| **Thumbnail** | OG image → First content image | **✅ NEW!** | ✅ |

