## 🛠️ Advanced Features

### Auto Thumbnail Priority

**1st Priority**: Meta tags
```html
<meta property="og:image" content="..." />
<meta name="twitter:image" content="..." />
```

**2nd Priority**: First content image
```html
<article>
  <img src="first-image.jpg" /> ← This one
  <img src="second-image.jpg" />
</article>
```

### Manual Override

Can still:
- ❌ Remove auto thumbnail
- 📤 Upload different image
- 🔗 Set custom URL
- ⬜ Leave empty

