## 🐛 Common Issues

### Issue: Thumbnail not auto-setting

**Check:**
```javascript
// Browser console (F12)
console.log('Has thumbnailUrl:', data.thumbnailUrl);
console.log('Has imageUrls:', data.imageUrls);
```

**Fix:**
- Try different article
- Manually set thumbnail
- Report issue

### Issue: Wrong thumbnail selected

**Reason**: Meta tag has different image than expected

**Fix:**
- Click ❌ to remove
- Upload correct image
- Or set by URL

